# {{projectName}}

This pnpm workspace contains TypeScript packages for Node.js. Use the Node version
in `.node-version` and pnpm version in `package.json`.

```sh
pnpm install --frozen-lockfile
pnpm build
pnpm test
pnpm validate
```

Start in `packages/example-library`. Edit the greeting in `src/index.ts` and
run `pnpm dev` to rebuild on changes. Packages consume each other by package name
through public exports.

See the [workspace guides](docs/README.md) to add a package or change the shared
tooling.
